OL,3,GNEWSALidl store to reopen after fatal
OL,4,Acar crash through entrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lidl supermarket in Wolverhampton is
OL,7,Fset to reopen almost two weeks after a
OL,8,Fcar crashed through the entrance,
OL,9,Fkilling a father-of-two and injuring
OL,10,Fseveral others.
OL,12,FThe Finchfield Hill store has remained
OL,13,Fclosed since the incident on 23
OL,14,FOctober, when James Singh Jagpal, 39,
OL,15,Fdied when a Renault Zoe crashed into
OL,16,Fthe supermarket shortly before 18:00
OL,17,FGMT.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
