OL,3,GNEWSALidl store to reopen after fatal
OL,4,Acar crash through entrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesman said the store was set to
OL,7,Freopen on Saturday after essential
OL,8,Frepairs and safety checks. The
OL,9,Fannouncement comes as thousands of
OL,10,Fpounds have been raised to support
OL,11,FJagpal's family with funeral costs.
OL,13,FThe driver, a woman in her 70s, was
OL,14,Falso hurt and has since been released
OL,15,Ffrom hospital. Police said she would be
OL,16,Fspoken to in due course.
